b/uploads/origins/f198c15b-32d4-4442-8aca-dd4b9d8d6de7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0aac4fb0a3abecf4db6b81660799c502 2x, https://si.imgix.net/492a690b/uploads/origins/f198c15b-32d4-4442-8aca-dd4b9d8d6de7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c91c965a07210deaac9f260f22cff291 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello, iwashi-sensei,\n\nI truly admire your adorable art style and would like to commission you to create an illustration of my favorite vtuber, Yua (悠亚). Yua is a liver from Virtuareal, the Chinese partner group of Nijisanji. Her character concept is an alien who loves penguins, disguised as a high school girl. On her uniform bag, there is a charm representing her fanbase. The charm's facial elements are derived from the name of her fans: UUQ.\n\nIn May, Virtuareal will hold its 6th Anniversary Celebration event, \"2025 Mixup!!\". I hope you could create an artwork of Yua wearing her performance outfit, set on stage while she's singing, surrounded by UUQs and a few adorable penguins cheering for her.\n\nBelow are reference links for your convenience.\n\nThank you for considering my request. This artwork will be used for personal appreciation and for creating support items to be distributed at the event venue. I truly hope you can accept this commission.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/18F0CswiwBr2x2ksRKl5GFVar1SpznbFK?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}]}